{
  "$description": "shadcn/ui's own 'Daylight' preset theme (new-york style), unmodified. Same token names as light.tokens.json/dark.tokens.json so it drops in as an alternate [data-theme] block. Sidebar tokens are not overridden by this preset upstream either, so they inherit the base theme's sidebar-* values.",

